# Curated ontology base. Generated from the tracked seed using explicit type rules.
# User records, account data, conversations, imports, and secret values are excluded.
# Rule IDs: BASE-SCHEMA, BASE-GLOBAL-TYPES, BASE-REGISTRY-CLOSURE, BASE-CATALOG-OVERLAY.
@prefix foundation: <http://foundation.local/ontology/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
