foundation:Attachment rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Attachment rdfs:comment "A file attached to a message for AI processing. Links a File to a Message with AI-specific metadata. (Label corrigido de 'Anexo' para 'Attachment' na revisão ontológica de 24 Mar 2026 19:00)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Attachment rdfs:label "Anexo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Attachment rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- Image sent to Claude for vision analysis (PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF)\n- PDF document for text extraction and analysis\n- Screenshot for debugging assistance\n- Diagram for architecture review\n\nSupported formats:\n- Images: PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF (for Claude Vision)\n- Documents: PDF (for Claude PDF support via Files API)\n- Text: TXT, MD, CSV (converted to text in prompt)\n\nArchitecture:\n- Attachment connects a File to a Message\n- File contains metadata (path, size, type, hash)\n- Attachment adds AI-specific data (base64, fileId for Claude API)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Attachment rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
