foundation:BrazilianNFSe rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:BrazilianNFSe rdfs:comment "Brazilian electronic service invoice (Nota Fiscal de Serviço Eletrônica)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:BrazilianNFSe rdfs:label "NFS-e"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:BrazilianNFSe rdfs:seeAlso "\nNFS-e (Nota Fiscal de Serviço Eletrônica) is the Brazilian electronic service invoice system.\n\nKey information:\n- Access key (chave de acesso) - unique 44-digit identifier\n- NFS-e number and competence date\n- Emission date and time\n- Service provider (prestador) and service taker (tomador)\n- Service description and values\n- Municipal taxation (ISSQN)\n- Federal taxation (IRRF, PIS, COFINS, Social Security)\n- Simples Nacional information\n- DPS (Declaração de Prestação de Serviço) information\n\nExample:\n  :nfse4 a foundation:BrazilianNFSe ;\n      foundation:nfseAccessKey \"41069022264110609000104000000000000426023827549219\" ;\n      foundation:nfseNumber \"4\" ;\n      foundation:nfseCompetenceDate \"2026-02-13\"^^xsd:date ;\n      foundation:nfseEmissionDateTime \"2026-02-13T10:34:43\"^^xsd:dateTime ;\n      foundation:nfseIssuerMunicipality :curitiba ;\n      foundation:nfseServiceProvider :terraTech ;\n      foundation:nfseServiceTaker :ingresse ;\n      foundation:nfseServiceLocation :curitiba ;\n      foundation:nfseISSQNMunicipality :curitiba ;\n      foundation:nfseServiceValue \"19140.85\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n      foundation:nfseNetValue \"19140.85\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n      foundation:invoiceCurrency currency:BRL ;\n      foundation:nfseSimplesNacionalOptant true ;\n      foundation:hasFile :nfse4_pdf .\n\nCardinality constraints:\n- nfseAccessKey: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseNumber: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseCompetenceDate: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseEmissionDateTime: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseIssuerMunicipality: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseServiceProvider: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseServiceTaker: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseServiceDescription: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseServiceValue: exactly 1 (required)\n- nfseNetValue: exactly 1 (required)\n- hasFile: max 1 (optional - PDF attachment)\n- All other properties: max 1 (optional)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:BrazilianNFSe rdfs:subClassOf foundation:Invoice .
