foundation:BudgetConsolidationRun rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AutomationExecutionControl .
foundation:Bug foundation:aiBehaviorRules "Use `foundation:bugOfUserStory` to link a bug to the User Story it was found against. Range is UserStory — no other entity type is valid.\n\nACCEPTANCE CRITERIA (a partir de 2026-06-05): para validar a correção de um Bug, use foundation:hasAcceptanceCriterion (object, range foundation:AcceptanceCriterion). Cada AC representa uma condição testavel discreta com status próprio (Pendente → Em Validação (QA) → Concluído/Rejeitado). QA só fecha o Bug quando TODOS os ACs estiverem Concluídos. Leia o aiBehaviorRules de foundation:AcceptanceCriterion para o protocolo. Coexiste com foundation:stepsToReproduce: stepsToReproduce descreve como reproduzir o sintoma do bug; hasAcceptanceCriterion descreve como validar que a CORREÇÃO funciona."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Bug foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Blocked .
foundation:Bug foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:Bug foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:Bug foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:Bug foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Rejected .
foundation:Bug foundation:cascadeDeleteRange foundation:hasAcceptanceCriterion .
foundation:Bug foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-bug_report .
foundation:Bug foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:Bug foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-06-05T14:41:08.921773800+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Bug rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Bug rdfs:comment "Um defeito em uma funcionalidade existente que causa comportamento incorreto ou inesperado. Bugs são reportados contra um produto, funcionalidade ou história de usuário específicos, incluem uma análise de causa e uma resolução quando corrigidos. Use UserStory para funcionalidade nova e melhorias — Bug é estritamente para defeitos."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Bug rdfs:label "Bug"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Bug rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:Bug rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_92a067fba3f92a0c .
foundation:Bug rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_dad1eba341f36eae .
foundation:BuyingPractice foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-shopping_cart_checkout .
foundation:BuyingPractice rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:BuyingPractice rdfs:comment "Uma prática, dica ou heurística acionável sobre COMO COMPRAR bem — negociação, inspeção do produto, cálculo de quantidade, canal alternativo, armadilha a evitar, janela de preço. Cada prática carrega a FONTE e o NÍVEL DE EVIDÊNCIA (consenso da comunidade x opinião isolada x contestada x medido), porque dica de fórum sem procedencia é palpite com cara de regra."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:BuyingPractice rdfs:label "Prática de Compra"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:BuyingPractice rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:CNH foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-directions_car .
foundation:CNH foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:CNH rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:CNH rdfs:comment "Carteira Nacional de Habilitação - Brazilian driver's license"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:CNH rdfs:label "CNH"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:CNH rdfs:seeAlso "\nThe CNH is the official driver's license in Brazil, issued by DETRAN.\n\nCardinality Constraints:\n- driverCategory: exactly 1 (required) - every CNH must have exactly one driver category\n\nExample:\n  :johnCNH a foundation:CNH ;\n      foundation:documentNumber \"12345678900\" ;\n      foundation:issuingAuthority \"DETRAN-SP\" ;\n      foundation:issueDate \"2018-03-20\"^^xsd:date ;\n      foundation:expirationDate \"2028-03-20\"^^xsd:date ;\n      foundation:driverCategory \"B\" .\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:CNH rdfs:subClassOf foundation:IdentificationDocument .
foundation:CPF foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-credit_card .
foundation:CPF foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:CPF rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:CPF rdfs:comment "Cadastro de Pessoa Física - Brazilian taxpayer identification"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:CPF rdfs:label "CPF"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:CPF rdfs:seeAlso "\nThe CPF is a unique taxpayer identification number in Brazil,\nissued by the Federal Revenue Service (Receita Federal).\n\nFormat: XXX.XXX.XXX-XX (11 digits)\n\nExample:\n  :johnCPF a foundation:CPF ;\n      foundation:documentNumber \"123.456.789-00\" ;\n      foundation:issueDate \"2005-01-10\"^^xsd:date .\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:CPF rdfs:subClassOf foundation:IdentificationDocument .
