foundation:EmailTriageItemRun rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:EmailTriageItemRun rdfs:comment "Instância de controle de UMA iteração do lote de triagem (um email). Criada pelo motor a cada item do loop; ligada à instância prim=ária (EmailBatchTriageRun) via foundation:iterationOf. Guarda o resultado da triagem do item em foundation:itemOutcome."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmailTriageItemRun rdfs:label "Execução de triagem de um email"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmailTriageItemRun rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AutomationExecutionControl .
foundation:EmailTriageRun foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:EmailTriageRun foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:EmailTriageRun foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-mark_email_read .
foundation:EmailTriageRun rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:EmailTriageRun rdfs:comment "Instância de controle (contexto de execução) de uma corrida da automação de triagem de emails. Não é entidade de domínio: representa UMA execução do processo de triagem, criada pelo motor no início (hasStatus=InProgress) e finalizada ao fim (Completed). Os nós gravam o resumo da corrida em foundation:triageOutcome via outputProperty. Arquétipo 'controlClass = contexto de execução' para automações que PROCESSAM entidades existentes (vs. classe de domínio à la Morning Briefing)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmailTriageRun rdfs:label "Execução de triagem de emails"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmailTriageRun rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AutomationExecutionControl .
foundation:EmploymentContract foundation:aiBehaviorRules "Padrão de nomenclatura para contratos: [Nome] - [Cargo]@[Empresa]. Exemplos: \"Andrew Deleon - Desenvolvedor Backend@Expert Integrado\", \"Reinan Carvalho - Engenheiro de IA@Expert Integrado\", \"Daniel Borlino - Diretor de Tecnologia@Expert Integrado\". Ao criar ou renomear contratos, siga este padrão."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmploymentContract foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:EmploymentContract foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:EmploymentContract foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:EmploymentContract foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-badge .
foundation:EmploymentContract foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-05-27T14:15:05.107851+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:EmploymentContract rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:EmploymentContract rdfs:comment "An employment record linking a person to a company, with contract dates, contract type, work relationship, salary, and benefits. Padrão de nomenclatura: [Nome] - [Cargo]@[Empresa]"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmploymentContract rdfs:label "Contrato de Trabalho"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmploymentContract rdfs:seeAlso "\nRepresents a formal employment relationship between a person and a company.\nThis is the central concept that links together:\n- The employee (Person)\n- The employer (Company)\n- The job occupation\n- Salary history\n- Contract details\n\nCardinality constraints:\n- employer: exactly 1 (required - must have exactly one employer)\n- admissionDate: exactly 1 (required - admission date is mandatory)\n- occupation: exactly 1 (required - must have exactly one job occupation)\n- terminationDate: 0-1 (at most one termination date)\n- contractType: 0-1 (one contract type: CLT, PJ, etc.)\n- workRelationship: 0-1 (one work relationship type)\n- initialSalary: 0-1 (one initial salary value)\n- lastSalary: 0-1 (one last salary value)\n- contractualSalary: 0-1 (one current contractual salary)\n\nExample:\n  :johnEmployment a foundation:EmploymentContract ;\n      foundation:hasEmploymentContract :john ;\n      foundation:employer :acmeCompany ;\n      foundation:occupation :softwareEngineerJob ;\n      foundation:admissionDate \"2020-01-15\"^^xsd:date ;\n      foundation:terminationDate \"2023-06-30\"^^xsd:date ;\n      foundation:contractType \"CLT\" ;\n      foundation:workRelationship \"Full-time\" ;\n      foundation:initialSalary \"5000.00\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n      foundation:lastSalary \"7500.00\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n      foundation:contractualSalary \"7500.00\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n      foundation:observations \"Registro na CTPS nº 123\" .\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:EmploymentContract rdfs:subClassOf foundation:Contract .
