foundation:FoundationApp rdfs:comment "The FOUNDATION application - a semantic knowledge management system"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:FoundationApp rdfs:label "FOUNDATION App"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:FoundationApp rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- The running instance of FOUNDATION on a user's computer\n- A specific installation of FOUNDATION\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:FoundationApp rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:FoundationProduct foundation:aiBehaviorRules "PERSONAS — regra de escolha: a persona principal de qualquer UserStory é sempre o Agente de Software (AI Agent), pois ele age em favor do usuário na maior parte do tempo. Use a persona de usuário humano (João ou Daniel) SOMENTE quando a história exigir interação direta do usuário com a UI — tela, formulário, widget, gesto, leitura visual. Se a capacidade puder ser entregue via agente sem que o usuário precise abrir uma tela, a persona é o Agente de Software."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:FoundationProduct foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-account_tree .
foundation:FoundationProduct foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-06-09T22:29:04.199466+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:FoundationProduct foundation:license "Open Source"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:FoundationProduct foundation:productName "Foundation CORE"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:FoundationProduct rdf:type foundation:SoftwareProduct .
foundation:FoundationProduct rdfs:comment "Motor headless do ecossistema Foundation. Contém o núcleo do sistema: ontologia RDF/OWL, engine de automação BPMN, harness de IA (LLM, tools, agentes), task scheduling, servidor MCP, campos calculados, subconsciente, integração email/IMAP, central de notificações e API pública CoreServices. Não possui interface de usuário própria — é consumido pelo Foundation Desktop ou Foundation Server."^^<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
foundation:FoundationProduct rdfs:comment "Sistema de gestão de conhecimento com suporte a ontologia semântica"^^<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
foundation:FoundationProduct rdfs:label "Foundation CORE"^^<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
foundation:FoundationProduct rdfs:seeAlso "\nThis represents the FOUNDATION product concept.\n\nInstallations link to this via foundation:productOf:\n  foundation:ThisFoundationInstance a foundation:Application ;\n    foundation:productOf foundation:FoundationProduct ;\n    foundation:version \"0.1.0\" ;\n    foundation:runsOn foundation:ThisComputer .\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
