foundation:IdentificationDocument rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- RG (Registro Geral - Brazil)\n- CPF (Cadastro de Pessoa Física - Brazil)\n- CNH (Driver's License - Brazil)\n- Passport\n- National ID Card\n- Social Security Card\n\nCardinality Constraints:\n- documentNumber: exactly 1 (required) - every identification document must have exactly one document number\n- issueDate: min 1 (required) - every identification document must have at least one issue date\n- issuingAuthority: max 1 - an identification document can have at most one issuing authority\n- expirationDate: max 1 - an identification document can have at most one expiration date\n- issuingCountry: max 1 - an identification document can have at most one issuing country\n- issuingLocation: max 1 - an identification document can have at most one issuing location\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:IdentificationDocument rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
