foundation:Loan foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-25T18:02:53Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Loan rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Loan rdfs:comment "A loan agreement between two parties — one lends money (creditor/lender) and the other commits to repay (debtor/borrower), with or without interest. As a Contract, it defines the terms of the agreement. It generates a FinancialObligation that tracks the outstanding balance and is settled by Payments."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Loan rdfs:label "Empréstimo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Loan rdfs:subClassOf foundation:Contract .
foundation:LocalAIAssistant rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:LowPriority foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:LowPriority rdf:type foundation:TaskPriority .
foundation:LowPriority rdfs:label "Low Priority"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPRequest foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-http .
foundation:MCPRequest foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-15T10:26:44Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:MCPRequest rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:MCPRequest rdfs:comment "A tool call request sent to the MCP server by an AI assistant, containing the tool name and its arguments."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPRequest rdfs:label "MCP Request"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPRequest rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:MCPResponse foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-http .
foundation:MCPResponse foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-15T10:26:44Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:MCPResponse rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:MCPResponse rdfs:comment "The result returned by the MCP server after executing a tool call, containing either a success payload or an error message."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPResponse rdfs:label "MCP Response"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPResponse rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:MCPTool foundation:aiBehaviorRules "**WHAT vs HOW** — MCPTools definem o CONTRATO PÚBLICO: functionName, inputSchema (parâmetros que o agente envia), outputSchema (o que o agente recebe de volta), toolDescription (o que a ferramenta faz em linguagem de usuário). NÃO inclua detalhes de implementação interna (HTTP server, compressão, bibliotecas Rust, mecanismos de transporte). O Claude Code decide COMO implementar o handler."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:MCPTool foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:MCPTool foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:MCPTool foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Rejected .
foundation:MCPTool foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-build .
foundation:MCPTool foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-06-07T20:22:18.426978+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:MCPTool rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:MCPTool rdfs:comment "Describes a tool exposed via the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Each MCPTool defines the contract (description, input and output schemas) that the AI uses to invoke it. Implemented by one or more SoftwareFeatures.\n\n`foundation:functionName` holds the exact string identifier used to call this tool at runtime — must match the `name` field in the corresponding `ToolTemplate` registered in `get_available_tools()`. This is the field used by AgentTask to filter which tools are available to the agent."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool rdfs:label "Ferramenta MCP"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 foundation:functionName "datasync_list_runs"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-build .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 foundation:hasStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 foundation:inputSchema "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"data_source_iri\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Optional. Narrow to one DataSource. Omit for every source.\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Optional outcome filter: 'foundation:InProgress' (still running), 'foundation:Completed' (finished), 'foundation:Status_1781300928559' (ended in error).\"},\"limit\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Maximum runs to return, newest first. Default 20, max 200.\"}},\"required\":[]}"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-10-29T11:10:38.472445+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 foundation:outputSchema "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"count\":{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Number of runs returned.\"},\"runs\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"Sync-run summaries, newest first.\"}},\"required\":[\"count\",\"runs\"]}"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 foundation:toolDescription "List sync runs (one per extract cycle of a DataSource), newest first: when each started and finished, how many items it staged, how many failed, and how it ended. Filter by `status` to see only the runs with a given outcome. Use this to answer whether a sync actually ran and how it went — the raw records only carry per-item state, never the shape of the pass."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 rdf:type foundation:MCPTool .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 rdfs:comment "Lists sync runs for DataSources, newest first, optionally filtered by source and outcome."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MCPTool_1793272238439 rdfs:label "datasync_list_runs"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MaritalStatus foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-favorite .
foundation:MaritalStatus foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:MaritalStatus rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:MaritalStatus rdfs:comment "Civil/marital status classification"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MaritalStatus rdfs:label "Estado Civil"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MaritalStatus rdfs:seeAlso "\nStandard marital status categories:\n- Single (Solteiro)\n- Married (Casado)\n- Divorced (Divorciado)\n- Widowed (Viúvo)\n- Domestic Partnership (União Estável)\n- Separated (Separado)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:MaritalStatus rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractQuality .
