foundation:Problem rdfs:comment "A challenge or issue that affects one or more objectives"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Problem rdfs:label "Problema"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Problem rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:Process foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:Process foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:Process foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:Process foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-schema .
foundation:Process rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Process rdfs:comment "Processo descritivo/manual modelado em BPMN 2.0. Não é executado pelo mecanismo de automação do FOUNDATION; serve para documentar fluxos de trabalho, procedimentos operacionais, processos de negócio e quaisquer sequências de atividades realizadas por pessoas ou sistemas externos. Contém process_FlowNode e process_SequenceFlow ligados via foundation:partOfProcess."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Process rdfs:label "Processo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Process rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_Process .
foundation:Processor foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-memory .
foundation:Processor foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:Processor foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Processor rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Processor rdfs:comment "A central processing unit (CPU) that executes program instructions"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Processor rdfs:label "Processador"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Processor rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- Intel Core i9-13900K\n- AMD Ryzen 9 7950X\n- Apple M3 Max\n- ARM Cortex-A78\n\nCardinality constraints:\n- processorModel: exactly 1 (required identifier)\n- architecture: exactly 1 (required specification)\n- coreCount: exactly 1 (required specification)\n- clockSpeed: 0-1 (optional, base frequency)\n- manufacturedBy: 0+ (optional manufacturer link)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Processor rdfs:subClassOf foundation:ConcreteContinuant .
foundation:Product foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:Product foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:Product foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:Product foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-inventory .
foundation:Product foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Product rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Product rdfs:comment "A product concept representing something that can be owned, produced, sold, or used by organizations or individuals"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Product rdfs:label "Produto"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Product rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- iPhone (physical product)\n- FOUNDATION Software (abstract product)\n- PostgreSQL Database (abstract product)\n- Dell Laptop (physical product)\n\nProducts can be:\n- Physical (tangible goods)\n- Abstract (software, services, intellectual property)\n\nCardinality constraints:\n- ownedBy: 0-1 (optional, product may have single owner)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Product rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:ProfessionalExperience rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:ProfessionalSkill foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:ProfessionalSkill foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-star .
foundation:ProfessionalSkill rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:ProfessionalSkill rdfs:comment "Uma habilidade, skill ou competência que uma pessoa possui"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:ProfessionalSkill rdfs:label "Competência Profissional"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:ProfessionalSkill rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractQuality .
foundation:Project foundation:aiBehaviorRules "PROJETO vs PRODUTO — regras de distinção:\n\n• Project = iniciativa com prazo, equipe, tarefas e entregável. Tem início e fim.\n• SoftwareProduct = o produto em si, permanente, independente de versão ou projeto.\n\nAntes de criar um Project, verifique:\n1. Existe um SoftwareProduct correspondente? Se não, crie-o primeiro.\n2. O Project deve apontar para esse produto via `delivers`.\n3. Use `hasFeature` para delimitar o escopo: quais features este projeto implementa.\n4. Use `hasObjective` para o objetivo de execução do projeto (ex: 'lançar v1 até Q2').\n\nNUNCA crie um Project com o mesmo nome do produto. O produto é o destino; o projeto é a jornada."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Project foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:Project foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:Project foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-folder_special .
foundation:Project foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:Project foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-03T19:39:33Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Project rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Project rdfs:comment "A time-bounded initiative with a defined goal, scope and set of deliverables — involving people, tasks and resources working towards a specific outcome.\n\nUSE Project when: you have a start/end, a team, tasks, sprints, and a concrete deliverable.\nDO NOT use Project to represent the product itself — use SoftwareProduct, PhysicalProduct or Service for that.\n\nA Project DELIVERS a Product. The Product exists before and after the Project.\nExample: 'Portal de Desenvolvedores' is a SoftwareProduct. 'Lançamento do Portal v1' is a Project that delivers it."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Project rdfs:label "Projeto"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Project rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:PropertyCondition foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-filter_alt .
foundation:PropertyCondition foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-07T18:12:18Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:PropertyCondition rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:PropertyCondition rdfs:comment "Property condition — event triggers only when a specific property meets certain criteria (value change, specific value, range)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyCondition rdfs:label "Property Condition"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyCondition rdfs:subClassOf foundation:EventCondition .
foundation:PropertyConnectionAddedEvent foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-link .
foundation:PropertyConnectionAddedEvent foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-07T18:12:18Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:PropertyConnectionAddedEvent rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:PropertyConnectionAddedEvent rdfs:comment "A connection was added to an entity. Triggers when a relationship to another entity is created."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyConnectionAddedEvent rdfs:label "Property Connection Added Event"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyConnectionAddedEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:EventType .
foundation:PropertyConnectionRemovedEvent foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-link_off .
foundation:PropertyConnectionRemovedEvent foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-07T18:12:18Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:PropertyConnectionRemovedEvent rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:PropertyConnectionRemovedEvent rdfs:comment "A connection was removed from an entity. Triggers when a relationship to another entity is deleted."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyConnectionRemovedEvent rdfs:label "Property Connection Removed Event"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyConnectionRemovedEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:EventType .
foundation:PropertyScope foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-tune .
foundation:PropertyScope foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-07T18:12:18Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:PropertyScope rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:PropertyScope rdfs:comment "Property scope — event triggers when a specific property changes on a concept."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyScope rdfs:label "Property Scope"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyScope rdfs:subClassOf foundation:EventScope .
foundation:PropertyValueChangedEvent foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-edit_attributes .
foundation:PropertyValueChangedEvent foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-07T18:12:18Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:PropertyValueChangedEvent rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:PropertyValueChangedEvent rdfs:comment "A property value changed on an entity. Triggers when a detail/property value is modified."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyValueChangedEvent rdfs:label "Property Value Changed Event"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:PropertyValueChangedEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:EventType .
foundation:Purchase foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-shopping_cart .
foundation:Purchase foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-06T01:23:41Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Purchase rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Purchase rdfs:comment "An agreement to acquire a product or service in exchange for payment. As a Contract, it defines the parties (buyer/seller), the item acquired, and the payment terms. The actual payments are FinancialTransactions that settle the FinancialObligation generated by this purchase."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Purchase rdfs:label "Compra"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Purchase rdfs:subClassOf foundation:Contract .
foundation:Quality foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-label .
foundation:Quality foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Quality rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Quality rdfs:comment "Entidades que QUALIFICAM outras — não existem sozinhas, sempre são \"de algo\". Funcionam como rótulos, atributos, categorias ou enumerações que outras entidades referenciam.\n\nPergunta-chave: \"Faz sentido falar dessa coisa sem mencionar a quem ela pertence?\" — se NÃO faz sentido isolada, é Quality.\n\nNão deve ser usada diretamente como pai. Use o atalho AbstractQuality (qualidades concretas autônomas são raras).\n\nExemplos: Status (Pendente é status DE algo), TaskPriority (Alta é prioridade DE uma tarefa), ExpenseCategory (Lazer é categoria DE uma despesa), BloodType, HexColor."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Quality rdfs:label "Qualidade"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Quality rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- A color (red, blue)\n- A status (completed, pending)\n- A priority level (high, medium, low)\n- Performance (fast, slow)\n- Complexity (simple, complex)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Quality rdfs:subClassOf owl:Thing .
foundation:QuestionOutputBlock foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-help .
foundation:QuestionOutputBlock rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:QuestionOutputBlock rdfs:comment "Bloco de conteúdo em mensagens IA representando uma pergunta com opções de resposta."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:QuestionOutputBlock rdfs:label "Question Output Block"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:QuestionOutputBlock rdfs:subClassOf foundation:ContentBlock .
foundation:RG foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-badge .
foundation:RG foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:RG rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:RG rdfs:comment "Registro Geral - Brazilian national identity card"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:RG rdfs:label "RG"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:RG rdfs:seeAlso "\nThe RG (Registro Geral) is the primary identification document in Brazil,\nissued by state governments (SSP).\n\nExample:\n  :johnRG a foundation:RG ;\n      foundation:documentNumber \"12.345.678-9\" ;\n      foundation:issuingAuthority \"SSP-SP\" ;\n      foundation:issueDate \"2010-05-15\"^^xsd:date .\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:RG rdfs:subClassOf foundation:IdentificationDocument .
foundation:RawDataRecord foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
