foundation:SocialEvent rdfs:comment "A social gathering or event involving people"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SocialEvent rdfs:label "Evento Social"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SocialEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:Event .
foundation:Software foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-code .
foundation:Software foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Software rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Software rdfs:comment "An installed instance of software running on a computer"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Software rdfs:label "Software"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Software rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- FOUNDATION v0.1.0 running on my MacBook\n- VS Code 1.85.0 installed on production server\n- PostgreSQL 16.1 running on database server\n\nHierarchy:\n  SoftwareProduct → SoftwareRelease → Software (installation)\n\n  Example:\n    FoundationProduct (the product)\n      → Foundation_v0_1_0 (release/version)\n        → ThisFoundationInstance (installation on this computer)\n\nCardinality constraints:\n- installedFrom: 0-1 (optional, links to specific version/release installed)\n- hasRepository: 0+ (optional, may have multiple repositories - mirrors, forks)\n- runsOn: 0+ (optional, may run on multiple computers)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Software rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:SoftwareAgent foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-smart_toy .
foundation:SoftwareAgent foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:SoftwareAgent foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:comment "Um agente de software ou sistema automatizado que atua de forma autônoma (natureza digital com capacidade de agente). O basePrompt (instruções do sistema) é armazenado como uma instância de TextContent vinculada via rdfs:seeAlso."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:label "Agente de Software"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- Claude (AI assistant)\n- FOUNDATION AI Assistant (local AI)\n- A chatbot\n- An automation script\n- A CI/CD pipeline agent\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AgentCapacity .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_3ccbbfb5bcd83148 .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_e70acd6487245953 .
foundation:SoftwareAgent rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_f444a8fcf8652664 .
foundation:SoftwareDependency foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-package_2 .
foundation:SoftwareDependency foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-16T16:02:59Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareDependency rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:SoftwareDependency rdfs:comment "A software library, framework or package that can be declared as a dependency in a project."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareDependency rdfs:label "Dependência de Software"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareDependency rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:aiBehaviorRules "**WHAT vs HOW** — Esta classe define O QUE a funcionalidade entrega (comportamento externo, contratos de API, casos de uso). NÃO inclua detalhes de COMO implementar (arquitetura, bibliotecas, protocolos internos, estratégias de compressão, mecanismos de transporte). O implementador (Claude Code) decide HOW baseado no WHAT documentado aqui."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:aiBehaviorRules "Before creating a new SoftwareFeature, sample 3-5 existing instances to understand the established pattern (properties used, relationships, naming). Match that pattern exactly.\n\nBefore creating a SoftwareFeature, always check if the scope fits better as a UserStory inside an existing feature. A feature is a broad, named capability (max 3 words, noun-based). A user story is a specific user need. If an existing feature already covers the domain, create a UserStory inside it — not a new feature."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Rejected .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-star .
foundation:SoftwareFeature foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-06-07T20:22:18.330147400+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareFeature owl:imports foundation:Goal .
foundation:SoftwareFeature rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:SoftwareFeature rdfs:comment "Uma capacidade ampla voltada para o usuário, decomposta em Histórias de Usuário que descrevem necessidades específicas do usuário. REGRAS DE NOMENCLATURA: (1) Máximo 3 palavras, (2) Use nomes e não verbos, (3) Sem sobreposição com outras funcionalidades. Cada funcionalidade deve resolver um ou mais Problemas."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareFeature rdfs:label "Funcionalidade"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareFeature rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- User Authentication\n- File Export\n- Dark Mode\n- Real-time Notifications\n- Search\n\nRelationship chain:\n  SoftwareFeature\n    ← UserStory (contributesTo) — specific user needs within this feature\n      ← Plan (contributesTo) — design perspective per story: Backend, Frontend, UI/UX, Data, Ontology\n        ← Task (contributesTo) — concrete work items, chained via dependsOn\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareFeature rdfs:subClassOf foundation:Goal .
foundation:SoftwareFeature rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_acb784d023f272cc .
foundation:SoftwareFeature rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_f384e9af5efce4f0 .
foundation:SoftwareLicense foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-verified .
foundation:SoftwareLicense foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-13T19:38:31Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareLicense rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:SoftwareLicense rdfs:comment "A license for a software tool, library, or service acquired by the organization."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareLicense rdfs:label "Licença de Software"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareLicense rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:SoftwareProduct foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-code .
foundation:SoftwareProduct foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:SoftwareProduct foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareProduct rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:SoftwareProduct rdfs:comment "Um produto de software — uma peça de software nomeada e persistente independente de qualquer versão, instalação ou projeto específico.\n\nUSE SoftwareProduct quando: você está descrevendo O QUE o software é (sua identidade, funcionalidades, personas, objetivos, arquitetura).\nNÃO use SoftwareProduct para representar um projeto ou iniciativa — use Project para trabalho com duração limitada.\n\nUm SoftwareProduct é ENTREGUE POR Projects e DECOMPOSTO EM SoftwareFeatures.\nExemplo: 'FOUNDATION' é um SoftwareProduct. 'Implementar funcionalidade X no Q2' é um Project que o entrega."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareProduct rdfs:label "Produto de Software"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareProduct rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- FOUNDATION (knowledge management system)\n- Visual Studio Code (code editor)\n- PostgreSQL (database system)\n- React (JavaScript library)\n- Docker (containerization platform)\n\nNote: This represents the SOFTWARE PRODUCT, not a specific installation.\nInstallations are instances of foundation:Application or foundation:Software\nlinked via foundation:productOf.\n\nExample:\n  foundation:FoundationProduct a foundation:SoftwareProduct ;\n    rdfs:label \"FOUNDATION\" ;\n    foundation:developedBy foundation:AnthropicOrg ;\n    foundation:licenseType \"GPL-3.0\" .\n\n  foundation:ThisFoundationInstance a foundation:Application ;\n    foundation:productOf foundation:FoundationProduct ;\n    foundation:version \"0.1.0\" .\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareProduct rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractProduct .
foundation:SoftwareRelease foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:SoftwareRelease foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:SoftwareRelease foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:SoftwareRelease foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-new_releases .
foundation:SoftwareRelease foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-05T03:40:04Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:SoftwareRelease rdfs:comment "A specific version/release of a software product that can be distributed, installed, or purchased"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease rdfs:label "Versão de Software"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- FOUNDATION v0.1.0\n- Visual Studio Code v1.85.0\n- PostgreSQL 16.1\n- React 18.2.0\n\nThis represents a SPECIFIC VERSION that can be:\n- Downloaded and installed\n- Purchased or licensed\n- Distributed to users\n\nHierarchy:\n  SoftwareProduct (e.g., \"Visual Studio Code\")\n    ↓ has multiple releases\n  SoftwareRelease (e.g., \"VS Code 1.85.0\")\n    ↓ can be installed as\n  Software/Application (e.g., \"VS Code 1.85.0 on my MacBook\")\n\nCardinality constraints:\n- releaseOf: exactly 1 (must be release of a specific product)\n- versionNumber: exactly 1 (required version identifier)\n- releaseDate: exactly 1 (required release date)\n- licenseType: 0-1 (optional, may differ per version)\n- changelog: 0-1 (optional description of changes)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 foundation:existsFrom "2026-10-29T00:00:00+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-rocket_launch .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 foundation:hasStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-10-29T11:10:53.249852+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 foundation:licenseType "AGPL-3.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 foundation:releaseOf foundation:FoundationProduct .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 foundation:versionNumber "0.19.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 rdf:type foundation:SoftwareRelease .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 rdfs:comment "Automação local e Data Sync, integração OpenRouter, melhorias de interface e extração do núcleo ontológico."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareRelease_1793272253227 rdfs:label "FOUNDATION v0.19.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareSetting foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:SoftwareSetting foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:SoftwareSetting foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-settings .
foundation:SoftwareSetting foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:SoftwareSetting foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:SoftwareSetting rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:SoftwareSetting rdfs:comment "A configuration setting with a key-value pair that originates from one software and is applied to another"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareSetting rdfs:label "Configuração"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareSetting rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- Max input tokens preference for AI service\n- Theme preference (dark/light mode)\n- Language preference\n- API endpoint configuration\n\nPattern:\n  :MaxTokensSetting a foundation:SoftwareSetting ;\n    foundation:settingKey \"maxInputTokens\" ;\n    foundation:settingValue \"50000\" ;\n    foundation:origin foundation:ThisFoundationInstance ;\n    foundation:appliedTo foundation:ClaudeAIService .\n\nThis allows tracking where settings come from and what they affect.\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:SoftwareSetting rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:Solution foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:Solution foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:Solution foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:Solution foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-done_all .
foundation:Solution foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:Solution rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:Solution rdfs:comment "A proposed approach or implementation to solve a problem"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Solution rdfs:label "Solução"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Solution rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n- Use RDF/OWL for base ontology (solution to ontology structure problem)\n- Implement topological sort for dependency resolution\n- Add rdfs:seeAlso examples to all classes\n- Use SQLite with immutable triple store architecture\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:Solution rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
