foundation:WidgetType_1793923655031 foundation:widgetUsageNote "Before composing or editing a semantic widget, search for foundation:SemanticComponentDefinition by componentId and use its highest componentContractVersion; read intent, schemas, actions, and examples with describe_individual. Every generated or updated JsonRenderSpec is linked automatically to the exact component contract versions used. When a contract hash changes, find specs linked to the old version through foundation:usesComponentContract and adapt only those, preserving intent and entity/property bindings; leave unaffected specs untouched. Specs are declarative data only: no JavaScript, HTML, callbacks, external modules, direct graph mutations, or destructive actions."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:WidgetType_1793923655031 rdf:type foundation:WidgetType .
foundation:WidgetType_1793923655031 rdfs:comment "Renders declarative UI specs through a semantic component catalog that resolves presentation from user intent and context."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:WidgetType_1793923655031 rdfs:label "Semantic JSON Render"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
