foundation:automation_EndEvent rdfs:comment "Evento de fim de um caminho da Automation. Pode haver vários (ex.: caminho de sucesso e caminho de erro/fallback)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_EndEvent rdfs:label "Fim"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_EndEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_EndEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_EndEvent .
foundation:automation_Event foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-event .
foundation:automation_Event foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_Event rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_Event rdfs:comment "Something that happens in BPMN process"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_Event rdfs:label "Evento de Automação"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_Event rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_ExclusiveGateway foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-call_split .
foundation:automation_ExclusiveGateway foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_ExclusiveGateway rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_ExclusiveGateway rdfs:comment "XOR - exactly one path taken"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_ExclusiveGateway rdfs:label "Decisão Exclusiva"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_ExclusiveGateway rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_FlowElement foundation:aiBehaviorRules "**Linking to a parent process:** both FlowNode and SubProcess use the same pattern — set `foundation:partOfProcess` on the child pointing to the parent Automation or SubProcess. There is no parent-to-child membership property."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_FlowElement foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-account_tree .
foundation:automation_FlowElement foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-20T18:53:52Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_FlowElement rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_FlowElement rdfs:comment "Abstract base for any element participating in a BPMN sequence flow. Subtypes: FlowNode (atomic tasks, events, gateways) and SubProcess (embedded child automation). Both are linked to their parent process via foundation:partOfProcess set on the child."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_FlowElement rdfs:label "Elemento de Fluxo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_FlowElement rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_FlowElement .
foundation:automation_FlowNode foundation:aiBehaviorRules "**Linking to a process:** set `foundation:partOfProcess` on this FlowNode pointing to the parent Automation or SubProcess. Membership is always declared from the child — there is no parent-to-child property."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_FlowNode foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:automation_FlowNode foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:automation_FlowNode foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:automation_FlowNode foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-flowchart .
foundation:automation_FlowNode foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:automation_FlowNode foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_FlowNode rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_FlowNode rdfs:comment "Base abstrata de todo nó atômico BPMN (StartEvent, EndEvent, Gateway, e as Tasks: CodeTask, AgentTask, RequestTask, TemplateTask, NOVAMessageTask). Liga-se à Automation via foundation:partOfProcess (do filho). Durante a execução, cada nó acessa a instância de controle (ctx['self']) para ler/escrever o estado compartilhado da corrida."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_FlowNode rdfs:label "Nó de Fluxo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_FlowNode rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowElement .
foundation:automation_FlowNode rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_FlowNode rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_98c054f00c999b1e .
foundation:automation_Gateway foundation:aiBehaviorRules "When creating a Gateway, always create outgoing SequenceFlows with conditionExpression. Cover all expected outcomes — at least one flow per branch. Use one flow without conditionExpression as the default/fallback. Set gatewayDirection to 'Diverging' for XOR splits."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_Gateway foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-merge .
foundation:automation_Gateway foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_Gateway rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_Gateway rdfs:comment "Nó de desvio/convergência BPMN. As SequenceFlows de saída com foundation:conditionExpression determinam o caminho (ex.: ramifica conforme um valor no contexto ou uma propriedade da instância de controle)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_Gateway rdfs:label "Decisão"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_Gateway rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_Gateway rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_Gateway .
foundation:automation_InclusiveGateway foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-merge .
foundation:automation_InclusiveGateway foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_InclusiveGateway rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_InclusiveGateway rdfs:comment "OR - one or more paths taken"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_InclusiveGateway rdfs:label "Decisão Inclusiva"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_InclusiveGateway rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_MessageEventDefinition foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-message .
foundation:automation_MessageEventDefinition foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:30Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_MessageEventDefinition rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_MessageEventDefinition rdfs:comment "Message-based trigger for BPMN events"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_MessageEventDefinition rdfs:label "Definição de Mensagem"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_MessageEventDefinition rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask foundation:aiBehaviorRules "`foundation:messagePayload` (template handlebars renderizado contra a instância de controle) é injetado como mensagem de usuário em `foundation:targetConversation` (opcional; ausente → conversa ativa mais recente) e a NOVA responde. Use SEMPRE este tipo para mandar mensagem à NOVA — nunca AgentTask. Útil como passo final de uma automação que quer avisar/entregar algo ao usuário na conversa."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-smart_toy .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-06-08T02:27:23.769501800+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask rdfs:comment "Nó que injeta uma mensagem (foundation:messagePayload, renderizada por handlebars contra a instância de controle) como mensagem de usuário numa conversa — foundation:targetConversation (opcional; ausente → conversa ativa mais recente) — e a NOVA responde. Para notificar/disparar a NOVA, use SEMPRE este tipo, nunca AgentTask."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask rdfs:label "Mensagem NOVA"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_Task .
foundation:automation_NOVAMessageTask rdfs:subClassOf _:restriction_f3a1e3408c85aa28 .
foundation:automation_ParallelGateway foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-call_merge .
foundation:automation_ParallelGateway foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_ParallelGateway rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_ParallelGateway rdfs:comment "AND - all paths taken simultaneously"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_ParallelGateway rdfs:label "Paralelo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_ParallelGateway rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_RequestTask foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-http .
foundation:automation_RequestTask foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-06-06T19:46:46.169488600+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_RequestTask rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_RequestTask rdfs:comment "Nó de requisição HTTP externa. Liga um foundation:HTTPRequest via foundation:requestInputRefs (url/método/headers renderizados por handlebars contra a instância de controle). Autenticação via foundation:usesCredential no HTTPRequest (OAuth2 → client-credentials grant → bearer; APIKey/Token → bearer; UsernamePassword → basic). A foundation:HTTPResponse (status/headers/body como um único JSON) é gravada na foundation:outputProperty da instância de controle."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_RequestTask rdfs:label "Tarefa de Requisição"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_RequestTask rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_RequestTask rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_Task .
foundation:automation_SequenceFlow foundation:aiBehaviorRules "When sourceRef is a Gateway, always set conditionExpression. Supported syntax:\n\n**1. Entity property comparison (DB-backed):**\n  contextKey.propertyName == 'value'\n  contextKey.propertyName != 'value'\n  The executor loads the entity at ctx[contextKey] from the database and reads foundation:propertyName from it.\n  Example: inputIRIs.hasStatus == 'foundation:InProgress'\n  Example: inputIRIs.hasStatus == 'foundation:Completed'\n\n**2. Context string contains:**\n  contextKey.includes('value')\n  Example: outputIRIs.includes('failed')\n\n**3. Context exact match:**\n  contextKey == 'value'\n  contextKey != 'value'\n\n**4. Context presence:**\n  contextKey       — true if ctx[contextKey] is non-empty\n  !contextKey      — true if ctx[contextKey] is absent or empty\n\nAvailable context keys:\n- inputIRIs: IRI passed as input to the process (e.g. the triggered User Story, Bug, etc.)\n- outputIRIs: value written to foundation:outputIRIs on any preceding FlowNode\n- Any key set via foundation:outputKey on a preceding FlowNode\n\nDo NOT use JavaScript syntax (arrow functions, .some(), .filter(), getStatus(), etc.)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_SequenceFlow foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-arrow_forward .
foundation:automation_SequenceFlow foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_SequenceFlow rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_SequenceFlow rdfs:comment "Aresta do grafo BPMN: liga dois FlowNodes via foundation:sourceRef → foundation:targetRef, com foundation:partOfProcess apontando para a Automation. Ramos condicionais avaliam foundation:conditionExpression (que pode ler ctx, ex.: inputIRIs)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_SequenceFlow rdfs:label "Fluxo de Sequência"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_SequenceFlow rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_SequenceFlow .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-api .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:30Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask rdfs:comment "Abstract base for automated tasks. All service tasks receive a set of IRIs as input and produce a set of IRIs as output — enabling type-safe composition between steps."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask rdfs:label "Tarefa de Serviço"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_ServiceTask rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_StartEvent foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:automation_StartEvent foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:automation_StartEvent foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-play_circle .
foundation:automation_StartEvent foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_StartEvent rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_StartEvent rdfs:comment "Evento de início de uma Automation (disparo manual). Marca onde a corrida começa. Liga-se à Automation via foundation:partOfProcess."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_StartEvent rdfs:label "Início"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_StartEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_StartEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_StartEvent .
foundation:automation_SubProcess foundation:aiBehaviorRules "**To add a SubProcess to a parent Automation:** set `foundation:partOfProcess` on the SubProcess pointing to the parent (identical pattern to FlowNode).\n\n**Required properties when creating a SubProcess:**\n1. `foundation:partOfProcess` → parent Automation\n2. `foundation:calledElement` → child Automation being embedded\n3. `foundation:hasSegway` for each output path (one per EndEvent of the child)\n\nSubProcess is NOT a FlowNode — never set `inputConcept` or `outputConcept` directly on it; those are resolved from the called Automation's StartEvent and EndEvents at render time."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_SubProcess foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-folder_open .
foundation:automation_SubProcess foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:30Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_SubProcess rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_SubProcess rdfs:comment "A container node that embeds a child Automation within a parent process. Extends FlowElement — it is NOT a FlowNode. It has no direct inputConcept/outputConcept; those are derived from the called Automation's StartEvent and EndEvents. Outputs are routed per SubProcessSegway. To place a SubProcess inside a parent Automation, set partOfProcess on the SubProcess pointing to the parent — the same pattern as FlowNode."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_SubProcess rdfs:label "Sub-processo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_SubProcess rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_SubProcess rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_SubProcess .
foundation:automation_SubProcessSegway foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-fork_right .
foundation:automation_SubProcessSegway foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-19T14:06:18Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_SubProcessSegway rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_SubProcessSegway rdfs:label "Segway de Sub-processo"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_SubProcessSegway rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_Task foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:automation_Task foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:automation_Task foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:automation_Task foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-task .
foundation:automation_Task foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_Task rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_Task rdfs:comment "Atomic unit of work in BPMN process"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_Task rdfs:label "Tarefa"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_Task rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask foundation:aiBehaviorRules "`foundation:templateBody` é um template handlebars renderizado contra a instância de controle; o resultado vai para `foundation:outputProperty`. Use quando a saída é composição DETERMINÍSTICA de dados já presentes na instância de controle (mais barato e previsível que um agente). Sintaxe ONTOLOGY-FIRST: `{{[foundation:prop]}}` (raiz), `{{resolve self 'foundation:a' 'rdfs:label'}}` (multi-nível), `{{#each [foundation:items]}}{{this.[rdfs:label]}}{{/each}}` (loops). Sem aliases amigáveis — sempre IRIs completas entre colchetes."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Completed .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:InProgress .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask foundation:allowedStatus foundation:Pending .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-text_snippet .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-06-08T02:27:23.764839600+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask rdfs:comment "Nó que renderiza um template handlebars (foundation:templateBody) contra a instância de controle e grava o resultado na foundation:outputProperty. Use (em vez de um agente) quando a saída é uma composição DETERMINÍSTICA de dados da instância de controle. Sintaxe ONTOLOGY-FIRST: {{[foundation:prop]}} (raiz=instância de controle), {{resolve self 'foundation:a' 'rdfs:label'}} (multi-nível), {{#each [foundation:items]}}...{{/each}} (loops)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask rdfs:label "Tarefa de Template"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_FlowNode .
foundation:automation_TemplateTask rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_Task .
foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-schedule .
foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T22:21:30Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition rdfs:comment "Definição de timer ligada a um automation_TimerStartEvent via foundation:eventDefinition. O cron (6 campos: sec min hour dom month dow) fica em foundation:timeCycle. O scheduler recarrega automaticamente ao escrever; um timer Pausado (Status_1773016842120) é pulado."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition rdfs:label "Definição de Timer"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition rdfs:subClassOf foundation:AbstractContinuant .
foundation:automation_TimerStartEvent foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-schedule .
foundation:automation_TimerStartEvent foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-17T23:55:45Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:automation_TimerStartEvent rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:automation_TimerStartEvent rdfs:comment "Evento de início disparado por timer. Ligado via foundation:eventDefinition a um foundation:automation_TimerEventDefinition cujo foundation:timeCycle contém um cron de 6 campos. O scheduler recarrega ao escrever; timer Pausado (Status_1773016842120) é pulado."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_TimerStartEvent rdfs:label "Início com Timer"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:automation_TimerStartEvent rdfs:subClassOf foundation:automation_StartEvent .
