foundation:bpmn_FlowElement rdf:type owl:Class .
foundation:bpmn_FlowElement rdfs:comment "Base abstrata BPMN para qualquer elemento que participa de um fluxo (FlowNode ou SubProcess). Subtipos: foundation:bpmn_FlowNode (atômico) e foundation:bpmn_SubProcess (composto). Pertence a um foundation:bpmn_Process via foundation:partOfProcess."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
