foundation:bpmn_Gateway rdfs:label "Decisão BPMN"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:bpmn_Gateway rdfs:subClassOf foundation:bpmn_FlowNode .
foundation:bpmn_Process foundation:aiBehaviorRules "Always set `foundation:hasRelatedClass` for every class this process or automation operates on. This enables organic discovery: agents calling `describe_class` on any of those classes will see this process in the backlinks under \"Processos e Automações Relacionados\" and will know to follow or run it before acting manually.\n\nWhen a process or automation appears in `describe_class` backlinks via `hasRelatedClass`, always check if it covers your task before proceeding ad-hoc."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:bpmn_Process foundation:hasIcon foundation:icon-material-symbols-name-schema .
