foundation:color rdfs:comment "Hex color code for visual representation. Uses custom datatype foundation:HexColor.\n\nSupported formats:\n  #RGB        — 3-digit shorthand (e.g. '#4CF')\n  #RRGGBB     — standard 6-digit (e.g. '#4CAF50')\n  #RRGGBBAA   — 8-digit with alpha channel (e.g. '#4CAF5080')\n\nAlpha channel (AA): 00 = fully transparent, FF = fully opaque."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
