foundation:hasCity rdfs:range foundation:City .
foundation:hasCity rdfs:seeAlso "\nThis property should be used instead of foundation:locality or foundation:postalTown\nfor new implementations. It provides a reference to a structured City entity.\n\nExample:\n  :myAddress foundation:hasCity :city_campinas .\n\n  :city_campinas a foundation:City ;\n      foundation:cityName \"Campinas\" ;\n      foundation:isPartOf :state_sao_paulo .\n\nBenefits over string property:\n- Enables city-level hierarchy navigation\n- Supports population, area, and other city data\n- Facilitates geographic queries and aggregations\n- Links to state/province and country entities\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
