foundation:hasIcon rdfs:comment "An icon assigned to any entity. ALL icon storage uses this single predicate: Material Symbol names as IRIs, image URLs and file:// paths as literals. When creating an individual with a photo/image as icon, pass the file path or URL directly in the `icon` field of `assert_individual`, or set via `replace_property_values` on `foundation:hasIcon` after creation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
