foundation:hasNeighborhood rdfs:seeAlso "\nThis property should be used instead of foundation:neighborhood for new implementations.\nIt provides a reference to a structured Neighborhood entity.\n\nExample:\n  :myAddress foundation:hasNeighborhood :neighborhood_cambui .\n\n  :neighborhood_cambui a foundation:Neighborhood ;\n      foundation:neighborhoodName \"Cambuí\" ;\n      foundation:isPartOf :city_campinas .\n\nBenefits over string property:\n- Enables neighborhood hierarchy navigation\n- Supports demographic and geographic data\n- Facilitates location-based queries\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
