foundation:hasRelatedClass rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .
foundation:hasRelatedClass rdfs:comment "Classes da ontologia às quais este processo ou automação se aplica. Usado para descoberta: ao chamar describe_class em qualquer dessas classes, este processo aparece nos backlinks."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:hasRelatedClass rdfs:domain foundation:bpmn_Process .
foundation:hasRelatedClass rdfs:label "Classes Relacionadas"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:hasRelatedClass rdfs:range owl:Class .
foundation:hasRepository foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-04-10T03:25:05.411569+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
foundation:hasRepository rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .
foundation:hasRepository rdfs:comment "Links software to its source code Git repository"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:hasRepository rdfs:domain foundation:Software .
foundation:hasRepository rdfs:label "Tem Repositório"^^<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
foundation:hasRepository rdfs:range foundation:GitRepository .
foundation:hasRepository rdfs:seeAlso "\nExample:\n  :ThisFoundationInstance foundation:hasRepository :FoundationGitRepo .\n  :VSCodeApp foundation:hasRepository :VSCodeGitRepo .\n\n  :FoundationGitRepo a foundation:GitRepository ;\n    foundation:repositoryUrl \"https://github.com/danielterra/FOUNDATION\"^^xsd:anyURI ;\n    foundation:defaultBranch \"main\" .\n\nNote:\n- Software installations may reference the same repository\n- Open source software typically has public repositories\n- Proprietary software may not have an accessible repository\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:hasResolvedEmail rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .
foundation:hasResolvedEmail rdfs:comment "Propriedade para resolução de template de email. Liga um item de resolução de template ao email resolvido."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:hasResolvedEmail rdfs:domain foundation:EmailTemplateResolutionItem .
foundation:hasResolvedEmail rdfs:label "Has Resolved Email"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:hasResolvedEmail rdfs:range foundation:Email .
foundation:hasResponse foundation:isSystemLocked "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
foundation:hasResponse foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-04-10T03:25:05.572519+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
