foundation:maxInputTokens rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty .
foundation:maxInputTokens rdfs:comment "Maximum number of tokens to SEND to the model per request (limits total input: system + tools + history + message). Default is 20% of context window. User can customize this value to control costs and context usage."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
