foundation:maxInputTokensPreference rdfs:seeAlso "\nExample:\n  foundation:LocalAIAssistant foundation:maxInputTokensPreference 50000 .\n\nFallback logic:\n1. Check agent's maxInputTokensPreference (user override)\n2. If not set, use model's maxInputTokens (model default)\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:maxOutputTokens foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-04-10T05:00:28.843005+00:00"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
