foundation:mediumType rdfs:seeAlso "\nExamples:\n\nDigital messaging:\n  :foundationChat foundation:mediumType \"chat\" .\n  :whatsappGroup foundation:mediumType \"chat\" .\n  :gmailService foundation:mediumType \"email\" .\n\nTelecommunication (via carriers):\n  :smsViaVivo foundation:mediumType \"sms\" .\n  :smsViaClaro foundation:mediumType \"sms\" .\n  :voiceCallVivo foundation:mediumType \"voice\" .\n  :voiceCallTMobile foundation:mediumType \"voice\" .\n\nVideo communication:\n  :zoomCall foundation:mediumType \"video\" .\n  :teamsVideoCall foundation:mediumType \"video\" .\n  :whatsappVideoCall foundation:mediumType \"video\" .\n\nPhysical:\n  :postalService foundation:mediumType \"physical\" .\n  :courierDelivery foundation:mediumType \"physical\" .\n\nBroadcast:\n  :telegramChannel foundation:mediumType \"broadcast\" .\n  :youtubeChannel foundation:mediumType \"broadcast\" .\n\nSuggested values: chat, email, sms, voice, video, physical, broadcast\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
