foundation:stopReason rdfs:label "Motivo de Parada"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
foundation:stopReason rdfs:range xsd:string .
foundation:stopReason rdfs:seeAlso "\nFor AIConversationMessage: Why the LLM stopped generating.\n\nValid values:\n- \"end_turn\": Natural completion (finished response)\n- \"tool_use\": Stopped to execute tools\n- \"max_tokens\": Hit token limit\n- \"stop_sequence\": Hit configured stop sequence\n\nExamples:\n  # Natural completion:\n  :msg1 foundation:stopReason \"end_turn\" .\n\n  # Needs tool execution:\n  :msg2 foundation:stopReason \"tool_use\" .\n\n  # Hit limit:\n  :msg3 foundation:stopReason \"max_tokens\" .\n\nOnly applicable to assistant messages (role=\"assistant\").\n\nCritical for control flow: If stopReason=\"tool_use\", the system must:\n1. Parse tool_use blocks from content\n2. Execute the tools\n3. Create user message with tool_result blocks\n4. Continue conversation\n"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
