qudt:SinglePrecisionRealEncoding rdfs:label "Single Precision Real Encoding"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
qudt:SolidAngleUnit foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
qudt:SolidAngleUnit <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The solid angle subtended by a surface S is defined as the surface area of a unit sphere covered by the surface S's projection onto the sphere. A solid angle is related to the surface of a sphere in the same way an ordinary angle is related to the circumference of a circle. Since the total surface area of the unit sphere is 4*pi, the measure of solid angle will always be between 0 and 4*pi."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
qudt:SolidAngleUnit rdf:type owl:Class .
qudt:SolidAngleUnit rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt> .
qudt:SolidAngleUnit rdfs:label "Solid Angle Unit"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
qudt:SolidAngleUnit rdfs:subClassOf qudt:AngleUnit .
qudt:Statement foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
qudt:Statement rdf:type rdfs:Class .
qudt:Statement rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt> .
qudt:Statement rdfs:label "Statement"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
qudt:Statement rdfs:subClassOf rdf:Statement .
qudt:Symbol foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
qudt:Symbol rdf:type owl:Class .
qudt:Symbol rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt> .
qudt:Symbol rdfs:label "Symbol"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
qudt:Symbol rdfs:subClassOf qudt:Concept .
qudt:SystemOfQuantityKinds foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
qudt:SystemOfQuantityKinds rdf:type owl:Class .
qudt:SystemOfQuantityKinds rdfs:comment "A system of quantity kinds is a set of one or more quantity kinds together with a set of zero or more algebraic equations that define relationships between quantity kinds in the set. In the physical sciences, the equations relating quantity kinds are typically physical laws and definitional relations, and constants of proportionality. Examples include Newton’s First Law of Motion, Coulomb’s Law, and the definition of velocity as the instantaneous change in position.  In almost all cases, the system identifies a subset of base quantity kinds. The base set is chosen so that all other quantity kinds of interest can be derived from the base quantity kinds and the algebraic equations. If the unit system is explicitly associated with a quantity kind system, then the unit system must define at least one unit for each quantity kind.  From a scientific point of view, the division of quantities into base quantities and derived quantities is a matter of convention."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
qudt:SystemOfQuantityKinds rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt> .
qudt:SystemOfQuantityKinds rdfs:label "System of Quantity Kinds"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
qudt:SystemOfQuantityKinds rdfs:subClassOf qudt:Concept .
qudt:SystemOfUnits foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
qudt:SystemOfUnits qudt:informativeReference "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Category:Systems_of_units"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
qudt:SystemOfUnits qudt:informativeReference "http://www.ieeeghn.org/wiki/index.php/System_of_Measurement_Units"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
qudt:SystemOfUnits rdf:type owl:Class .
qudt:SystemOfUnits rdfs:comment "A system of units is a set of units which are chosen as the reference scales for some set of quantity kinds together with the definitions of each unit. Units may be defined by experimental observation or by proportion to another unit not included in the system. If the unit system is explicitly associated with a quantity kind system, then the unit system must define at least one unit for each quantity kind."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
qudt:SystemOfUnits rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/2.1/schema/qudt> .
qudt:SystemOfUnits rdfs:label "System of Units"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
qudt:SystemOfUnits rdfs:subClassOf qudt:Concept .
qudt:SystemOfUnits rdfs:subClassOf qudt:Verifiable .
