qudt:hasNonCoherentUnit <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A coherent unit of measurement for a unit system is a defined unit that may be expressed as a product of powers of the system's base units with the proportionality factor of one."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
