qudt:isDeltaQuantity rdfs:comment "This property is used to identify a Quantity instance that is a measure of a change, or interval, of some property, rather than a measure of its absolute value. This is important for measurements such as temperature differences where the conversion among units would be calculated differently because of offsets."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
