qudt:maxExclusive <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "maxExclusive is the exclusive upper bound of the value space for a datatype with the ordered property. The value of maxExclusive must be in the value space of the base type or be equal to {value} in {base type definition}."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
