qudt:udunitsCode <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The UDUNITS package supports units of physical quantities. Its C library provides for arithmetic manipulation of units and for conversion of numeric values between compatible units. The package contains an extensive unit database, which is in XML format and user-extendable. The package also contains a command-line utility for investigating units and converting values."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
