unit:AT-PER-IN <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  The $\\textit{Ampere Turn per Inch}$ is a measure of magnetic field intensity and is equal to 12.5664 Oersted.\n  "^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
