unit:ATM-M3-PER-MOL foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
unit:ATM-M3-PER-MOL <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "\n  The unit $\\textit{Atmosphere Cubic Metre per Mole}$ consists of the power of the SI base unit metre with the exponent 3 multiplied by the unit atmosphere divided by the SI base unit mol.\n  "^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
