unit:BARYE <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "<p>The barye, or sometimes barad, barrie, bary, baryd, baryed, or barie, is the centimetre-gram-second (CGS) unit of pressure. It is equal to 1 dyne per square centimetre.</p>"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
