unit:CAL_TH qudt:latexDefinition "$1 \\; cal_{th} = 4.184 J$\n\n$\\approx 0.003964 BTU$\n\n$\\approx 1.163 \\times 10^{-6} kWh$\n\n$\\approx 2.611 \\times 10^{19} eV$"^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
