unit:C_Stat foundation:lastUpdatedAt "2026-03-04T04:10:29Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
unit:C_Stat <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The statcoulomb ($statC$) or franklin ($Fr$) or electrostatic unit of charge ($esu$) is the physical unit for electrical charge used in the centimetre-gram-second system of units (cgs) and Gaussian units. It is a derived unit given by $1\\ statC = 1\\ g\\ cm\\ s = 1\\ erg\\ cm$. The SI system of units uses the coulomb (C) instead. The conversion between C and statC is different in different contexts. The number 2997924580 is 10 times the value of the speed of light expressed in meters/second, and the conversions are exact except where indicated. The coulomb is an extremely large charge rarely encountered in electrostatics, while the statcoulomb is closer to everyday charges."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-ESU> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:conversionMultiplier "0.00000000033356409519815207"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:conversionMultiplierSN "0.00000000033356409519815207"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:dbpediaMatch "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Statcoulomb"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:derivedUnitOfSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-ESU> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:exactMatch unit:FR .
unit:C_Stat qudt:hasDimensionVector <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E1L0I0M0H0T1D0> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:hasQuantityKind <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/ElectricCharge> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:informativeReference "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statcoulomb?oldid=492664360"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:latexDefinition "$1 C \\leftrightarrow 2997924580 statC \\approx 3.00 \\times 10^9 statC,\\ 1 \\hspace{0.3pc} statC \\leftrightarrow \\hspace{0.3pc} \\approx 3.34 \\times 10^{-10} C$ for electric charge."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:latexDefinition "$1 C \\leftrightarrow 4 \\pi \\times 2997924580 statC \\approx 3.77 \\times 10^{10} statC,\\ 1 \\hspace{0.3pc} statC \\leftrightarrow \\hspace{0.2pc} \\approx 2.6 \\times 10^{-11} C$ for electric flux $\\Phi_D$"^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
unit:C_Stat qudt:latexDefinition "$1 C/m \\leftrightarrow 4 \\pi \\times 2997924580 \\times 10^{-4} statC/cm \\approx 3.77 \\times 10^6 statC/cm,\\ 1 \\hspace{0.3pc} statC/cm \\leftrightarrow \\hspace{0.3pc} \\approx 2.65 \\times 10^{-7} C/m$ for electric displacement field $D$."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
