unit:FARAD_Ab <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An abfarad is an obsolete electromagnetic (CGS) unit of capacitance equal to $10^{9}$ farads (1,000,000,000 F or 1 GF). The absolute farad of the e.m.u. system, for a steady current identically $abC/abV$, and identically reciprocal abdaraf. 1 abF = 1 GF."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
