unit:FARAD_Ab-PER-CentiM <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The absolute dielectric constant of free space is defined as the ratio of displacement to the electric field intensity. The unit of measure is the abfarad per centimeter, a derived CGS unit."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
