unit:GM qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-GAUSS> .
unit:GM qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/SI> .
unit:GM qudt:conversionMultiplier "0.001"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
unit:GM qudt:conversionMultiplierSN "0.001"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
unit:GM qudt:dbpediaMatch "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gram"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
