unit:IN_H2O_39dot2DEG_F <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "non SI-conform unit of pressure according to the Anglo-American and Imperial system for units, whereas the value of 1 inH₂O meets the static pressure, which is generated by a head of water at a temperature of 39.2°F with a height of 1 inch"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
