unit:J-PER-M2 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Joule Per Square Meter ($J/m^2$) is a unit in the category of Energy density. It is also known as joules per square meter, joule per square metre, joule/square meter, joule/square metre. This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
