unit:KiloGM-PER-HA <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Kilogram Per Hectare is a unit of mass per area. Kilogram Per Hectare (kg/ha) has a dimension of ML-2 where $M$ is mass, and $L$ is length. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit kg/m2 by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.0001."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
