unit:MI3 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A cubic mile is an imperial / U.S. customary unit of volume, used in the United States, Canada, and the United Kingdom. It is defined as the volume of a cube with sides of 1 mile in length. "^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
