unit:MO <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A unit of time corresponding approximately to one cycle of the moon's phases, or about 30 days or 4 weeks. Also known as the 'Synodic Month' and calculated as 29.53059 days."^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML> .
