unit:PlanckEnergy qudt:dbpediaMatch "http://dbpedia.org/resource/Planck_energy"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
unit:PlanckEnergy qudt:derivedUnitOfSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/PLANCK> .
