unit:SUSCEPTIBILITY_ELEC qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/IMPERIAL> .
unit:SUSCEPTIBILITY_ELEC qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/PLANCK> .
unit:SUSCEPTIBILITY_ELEC qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/SI> .
unit:SUSCEPTIBILITY_ELEC qudt:conversionMultiplier "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
unit:SUSCEPTIBILITY_ELEC qudt:conversionMultiplierSN "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
