unit:S_Ab <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The CGS electromagnetic unit of conductance; one absiemen is the conductance at which a potential of one abvolt forces a current of one abampere; equal to $10^{9}$ siemens. One siemen is the conductance at which a potential of one volt forces a current of one ampere and named for Karl Wilhem Siemens."^^<http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString> .
